<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" data-next-head=""/><link rel="icon" href="/liquify_favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" sizes="any" data-next-head=""/><script type="application/ld+json" data-next-head="">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.liquify.io/#organization","name":"Liquify","legalName":"Liquify Ltd","url":"https://www.liquify.io","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.liquify.io/assets/liquify_logo_white.svg"},"foundingDate":"2021","email":"contact@liquify.io","description":"UK-based bare-metal blockchain infrastructure provider focused on performance, decentralisation, uptime, and security.","sameAs":["https://github.com/liquify-validation","https://medium.com/@liquify","https://twitter.com/Liquify_ltd","https://www.youtube.com/@LiquifyLTD"]}</script><script type="application/ld+json" data-next-head="">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.liquify.io/#website","name":"Liquify","url":"https://www.liquify.io","publisher":{"@id":"https://www.liquify.io/#organization"}}</script><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/logo.2g1k-j2q5l7qy.svg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><meta charSet="utf-8" data-next-head=""/><title data-next-head="">Liquify - Secure &amp; Reliable Blockchain Infrastructure</title><meta name="description" content="Secure, Fast and Reliable Infrastructure for your Blockchain Business. Grow securely knowing that your blockchain infrastructure is in the hands of experts." data-next-head=""/><meta name="robots" content="index, follow" data-next-head=""/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.liquify.io/" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:title" content="Liquify - Secure &amp; Reliable Blockchain Infrastructure" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:description" content="Secure, Fast and Reliable Infrastructure for your Blockchain Business. Grow securely knowing that your blockchain infrastructure is in the hands of experts." data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:image" content="https://www.liquify.io/assets/liquify_dashboard.svg" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:type" content="website" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:url" content="https://www.liquify.io/" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Liquify - Secure &amp; Reliable Blockchain Infrastructure" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Secure, Fast and Reliable Infrastructure for your Blockchain Business. Grow securely knowing that your blockchain infrastructure is in the hands of experts." data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.liquify.io/assets/liquify_dashboard.svg" data-next-head=""/><script type="application/ld+json" data-next-head="">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Who are Liquify?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We are a UK based Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS) company supporting institutions and foundations in DeFi, Web3 and blockchain industries. Liquify Ltd's Information Security Management System is certified to ISO/IEC 27001:2022 by NQA. Read more about our story here"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Liquify?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Liquify team brings years of experience in devops, security, automation and global infrastructure set up with focus on quality of service and decentralisation. Liquify owns bare metal servers in the US, Europe and Asia and supports over 100+ chains. Read more about our story here"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why bare metal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"In the spirit of decentralisation our infrastructure is proprietary bare-metal servers meaning that we can really guarantee up-time and efficiency. We truly believe that the Web 3.0 industry can only reach decentralisation by limiting cloud infrastructure reliance and adding certified bare-metal providers with global coverage to secure networks. Read more here"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is your coverage?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Liquify has servers in the US (East and West), Europe (UK and Germany) and Asia (Singapore and Japan)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What services do you provide?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Liquify Ltd offers various different services including: Infrastructure as a Service (validators, RPC nodes, relayers, snapshots, etc.); Staking (white-label service for institutional clients); Dashboards and Monitoring Solutions (building custom projects for communities and foundations); Ecosystem Development (implementation of changes and chain updates)."}}]}</script><meta charSet="UTF-8"/><script defer="" src="https://cloud.umami.is/script.js" data-website-id="f9c8be77-48b2-442e-b9cc-8bac6b65594a"></script><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/a218039a3287bcfd-s.p.43zbiuwnnoiok.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/8e6fa89aa22d24ec-s.p.2o7m9ogm38dql.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/e2334d715941921e-s.p.3o_v2fun1jzxk.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/47fe1b7cd6e6ed85-s.p.3bh2vc0w-r-ll.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/829ba4228c966254-s.p.2mm3nq9i83l-m.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/4b766aa38fdaaae3-s.p.11-gljxdt344a.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/m