e x1="720" y1="-60" x2="30" y2="960" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.04)" stroke-width="1"></line></g><g><line x1="720" y1="-60" x2="136.15384615384616" y2="960" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.04)" stroke-width="1"></line></g><g><line x1="720" y1="-60" x2="242.30769230769232" y2="960" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.04)" stroke-width="1"></line></g><g><line x1="720" y1="-60" x2="348.46153846153845" y2="960" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.04)" stroke-width="1"></line></g><g><line x1="720" y1="-60" x2="454.61538461538464" y2="960" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.04)" stroke-width="1"></line></g><g><line x1="720" y1="-60" x2="560.7692307692308" y2="960" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.04)" stroke-width="1"></line></g><g><line x1="720" y1="-60" x2="666.9230769230769" y2="960" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.04)" stroke-width="1"></line></g><g><line x1="720" y1="-60" x2="773.0769230769231" y2="960" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.04)" stroke-width="1"></line></g><g><line x1="720" y1="-60" x2="879.2307692307693" y2="960" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.04)" stroke-width="1"></line></g><g><line x1="720" y1="-60" x2="985.3846153846154" y2="960" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.04)" stroke-width="1"></line></g><g><line x1="720" y1="-60" x2="1091.5384615384617" y2="960" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.04)" stroke-width="1"></line></g><g><line x1="720" y1="-60" x2="1197.6923076923076" y2="960" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.04)" stroke-width="1"></line></g><g><line x1="720" y1="-60" x2="1303.8461538461538" y2="960" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.04)" stroke-width="1"></line></g><g><line x1="720" y1="-60" x2="1410" y2="960" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.04)" stroke-width="1"></line></g></svg></div><div class="liq-narrative-content relative mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-16 w-full"><div class="liq-narrative-header mb-10 flex items-end justify-between gap-[60px]"><div><div class="liq-eyebrow"><span class="liq-eyebrow-dot"></span> <!-- -->Why teams switch</div><h2 class="liq-h2 max-w-[720px]">Four reasons our customers<br/><span class="liq-h2-gradient">stop shopping for infra.</span></h2></div><div class="liq-progress-rail"><div class="liq-progress-meta"><span>01<!-- --> /<!-- --> <!-- -->04</span><span>2x your throughput</span></div><div class="liq-progress-bar"><div class="liq-progress-fill" style="width:0%"></div><div class="liq-progress-tick liq-progress-tick--active" style="left:0%"></div><div class="liq-progress-tick " style="left:25%"></div><div class="liq-progress-tick " style="left:50%"></div><div class="liq-progress-tick " style="left:75%"></div></div></div></div><div class="liq-narrative-track"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="liq-narrative-panels relative"><div class="liq-beat-panel"><div class="mb-[18px] flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="liq-beat-marker-lg">01</div><div class="liq-kicker">2x your throughput</div></div><h3 class="liq-beat-title">Push twice the volume
without changing your stack.</h3><p class="liq-beat-desc">Our regional load balancer keeps your existing endpoint and routes around node saturation. Customers see a 1.8-2.4x headroom uplift in the first week - no SDK changes, no migrations.</p><div class="liq-beat-stat-row mt-8 flex items-baseline gap-3.5"><span class="liq-beat-stat">2.18x</span><span class="liq-kicker">avg throughput uplift</span></div></div><div class="liq-beat-panel"><div class="mb-[18px] flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="liq-beat-marker-lg">02</div><div class="liq-kicker">One portal, 100+ chains</div></div><h3 class="liq-beat-title">One portal.
100+ chains.</h3><p class="liq-beat-desc">Ethereum, Solana, Base, Arbitrum, Optimism, Polygon - 100+ chains available through the Liquify Portal. Explore networks and add new chains without juggling multiple vendors.</p><div class="liq-beat-stat-row mt-8 flex items-baseline gap-3.5"><span class="liq-beat-stat">100+</span><span class="liq-kicker">chains | one portal</span></div></div><div class="liq-beat-panel"><div class="mb-[18px] flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="liq-beat-marker-lg">03</div><div class="liq-kicker">Latency you can show off</div></div><h3 class="liq-beat-title">p50 under 40ms,
globally.</h3><p class="liq-beat-desc">6 edge regions co-located with the validator fleet, engineered for low latency, strong uptime, and consistent performance across every deployment.</p><div class="liq-beat-stat-row mt-8 flex items-baseline gap-3.5"><span class="liq-beat-stat">33ms</span><span class="liq-kicker">global p50, live</span></div></div><div class="liq-beat-panel"><div class="mb-[18px] flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="liq-beat-marker-lg">04</div><div class="liq-kicker">Validators that don&#x27;t slash</div></div><h3 class="liq-beat-title">Slashing protection.
