lass="flex flex-col gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between"><div class="flex-1"><p class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-[#8fd5ff]">Security &amp; Compliance</p><h2 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-white md:text-5xl">Independent certification backed by day-to-day security practice.</h2><p class="liq-copy-lead pt-5 max-w-3xl">Liquify Ltd&#x27;s Information Security Management System is certified to ISO/IEC 27001:2022 by NQA. Our security posture is built on operational discipline, not just a certificate.</p></div><div class="shrink-0 md:pt-2"><div class="inline-flex rounded-xl bg-white p-2 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)]"><img alt="ISO/IEC 27001:2022 Certified by NQA UKAS" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="block" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fnqa_bade.2_tecm4rufiac.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fnqa_bade.2_tecm4rufiac.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fnqa_bade.2_tecm4rufiac.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div><div class="grid gap-6 px-6 py-8 md:grid-cols-3 md:px-10"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/4 p-6 shadow-[0_18px_45px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)]"><div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[rgba(1,148,254,0.12)] ring-1 ring-[rgba(1,148,254,0.25)]"><svg class="h-6 w-6 text-[#8fd5ff]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.6" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 0 1 3.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 0 0 3 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285Z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">ISO/IEC 27001:2022</h3><p class="liq-copy-body mt-3">Liquify Ltd&#x27;s Informatio