iv></div></a></div></div></section><div class="bg_liquify mx-auto sm:mx-0 px-16 sm:px-0 bg-blur"><div><section class="liquify-home-signup relative overflow-hidden"><div class="relative z-2 mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[820px] text-center"><div class="home-liq-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:24px"><span class="dot"></span> Monthly digest</div><h2 class="home-liq-h2" style="font-size:clamp(2.75rem, 6vw, 4rem)">Don&#x27;t miss an<!-- --> <em class="home-liq-gradient-text">update.</em></h2><p class="home-liq-lead mx-auto" style="margin-top:20px;max-width:620px;text-align:center">What we shipped, what broke and how we fixed it, plus chains we&#x27;re wiring up next. One email, written by the engineers.</p><div class="mt-9 flex justify-center"><div class="w-full max-w-[560px]"><form class="home-liq-signup-form"><input type="email" class="home-liq-signup-input" placeholder="Enter your email" aria-label="Email address" value=""/><button type="submit" class="home-liq-btn home-liq-btn--primary">Subscribe</button></form><p class="home-liq-privacy mx-auto">We respect your privacy and will not share your e-mail address with any third party. Your personal data will be processed in accordance with our<!-- --> <a href="/privacy_policy.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a>.</p></div></div></div><div class="home-liq-portal-stage"><div class="home-liq-portal-glow"></div><div class="home-liq-portal-horizon"></div><div class="home-liq-portal-frame"><div class="home-liq-portal-canvas" style="--home-liq-portal-scale:1"><div style="width:1180px;height:680px;position:relative;background:linear-gradient(180deg, #0A0F2C 0%, #080B2A 100%);overflow:hidden"><div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27; width=&#x27;28&#x27; height=&#x27;32&#x27; viewBox=&#x27;0 0 28 32&#x27;&gt;&lt;path d=&#x27;M14 1l12 7v16l-12 7-12-7V8z&#x27; fill=&